# core/data/talk/grammar/en/rest_talk.tlk - the flow of the talk (new topic, go on, mm-hm, "what?")
# and talk about people who are not here (gossip, defending, accusing, taking sides, mediating)
# (owner: TK; T5b package T5B-OPEN). Clean in any room, no register word, no romance; gossip stays
# gentle (nothing cruel about a child, ever). Rule names start with r_. Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- CHANGE_TOPIC ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.change_topic.r_plain act: answer
  "Okay, new subject! I love a fresh start. What's next?"
  "Sure, let's switch. The old topic was getting tired."
  "Changing the subject? Smooth. I'll allow it."
  "Fine by me. That one was running out of steam."
@rule core.change_topic.r_topic guard: topic act: tell
  "Ooh, {x}! Now that's one I could talk about all night."
  "{x:cap}? Fine, but I have so many opinions. Buckle up."
  "Speaking of {x}, I have a story. It's short. It's not."
@rule core.change_topic.r_topic2 guard: topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}! Yes, let's do that. It deserves more air time."
  "Good idea. {x:cap} deserves more air time."
@rule core.change_topic.r_topic3 guard: topic act: opine_neg
  "{x:cap}? Hmm. I'm not thrilled, but you've got my ear."
@rule core.change_topic.r_like act: change_topic
  "While we're at it, have you thought about {like}? Just asking."
  "Funny, I was about to bring up {like}. Great minds."
  "Let's talk about {like}, then. My favourite, no offence."
@rule core.change_topic.r_joke act: joke
  "Subject changed! The old one will be in the corner, sulking."
  "Wow, topic whiplash. My neck. My dignity."
@rule core.change_topic.r_polite guard: polite act: answer
  "Of course. By all means, let us turn to something else."
@rule core.change_topic.r_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: answer
  "Okay! Can we talk about snacks, or dragons, or snack dragons?"
@rule core.change_topic.r_blunt guard: blunt act: answer
  "Sure. That topic was boring anyway."

# ---- CONTINUE and BACKCHANNEL --------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.continue.r_tell act: tell
  "Right, so where was I? Ah, yes. The part with the teapot."
  "And that's when things got interesting. Slightly. Not very."
  "Okay, so, the thing is. I forgot the thing. Hang on."
  "So I said to myself, I said, this is a problem. And it was."
@rule core.continue.r_answer act: answer
  "Yes, sure, go on. I'm all ears. Two of them."
  "Please do. I'm listening. I even sat down."
@rule core.continue.r_joke act: joke
  "Continue! Don't mind me. I'll just hold my breath for effect."
@rule core.continue.r_dismiss act: dismiss
  "I'd rather not go on. Some stories need a rest."
@rule core.backchannel.r_tell act: tell
  "Right, right. And it gets better. I promise."
  "Mm. And you know what else? Everything else."
  "Yeah, it's a thing, isn't it? I've been thinking about it."
@rule core.backchannel.r_continue act: continue
  "Mm-hm. Go on, I'm listening."
  "Yes. Yes yes yes. Keep going."
@rule core.backchannel.r_ask act: ask_about
  "You've gone quiet. What's on your mind? You can say it."
  "Penny for your thoughts? I'll give you a dime."
@rule core.backchannel.r_change act: change_topic
  "Well, we could talk about something else. Anything. Weather?"
@rule core.backchannel.r_joke act: joke
  "That was a very meaningful nod. I felt it in my soul."
  "Mm-hm, mm-hm, mm. I'm fluent in that."
@rule core.backchannel.r_back act: backchannel
  "Yep."
  "Mm-hm, sure."
  "Okay, then."
@rule core.backchannel.r_laugh act: laugh
  "Heh. You're a quiet one. I like it."
@rule core.backchannel.r_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: tell
  "Yeah! And then, and then, I forgot. Wait."

# ---- UNKNOWN: the parser did not get it ---------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.unknown.r_repeat act: ask_repeat
  "Sorry, say that again? I was distracted by a moth."
  "Hm? Slower, please. I'm not fast, I'm warm."
  "Come again? The words went in and got lost."
  "Could you put that another way? Or a third way?"
@rule core.unknown.r_joke act: joke
  "Interesting! I understood none of that. But I loved it."
  "Wow. That's the most confusing thing I've heard today."
  "Is that a riddle? I'm bad at riddles, give me a big clue."
@rule core.unknown.r_change act: change_topic
  "I don't follow. Shall we talk about something I do know?"
  "Okay, that lost me. How about soup? Everyone knows soup."
@rule core.unknown.r_back act: backchannel
  "Mm, sure, mm-hm. Of course."
  "Right, absolutely, yes. Whatever that was."
@rule core.unknown.r_answer act: answer
  "Not sure I understand, but it sounds lovely."
  "I'm going to take that as a compliment."
@rule core.unknown.r_polite guard: polite act: ask_repeat
  "I beg your pardon? I'm afraid I didn't follow."
@rule core.unknown.r_blunt guard: blunt act: ask_repeat
  "What? Speak up, or speak sense, or both."
@rule core.unknown.r_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: ask_repeat
  "Huh? I didn't get that. Can you say it with sounds?"
@rule core.unknown.r_elder guard: elder act: ask_repeat
  "Eh? Speak up, dear. My ears are on holiday."

# ---- GOSSIP and the people who are not here -----------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.gossip.r_more act: gossip
  "No! Tell me more, and don't skimp on details."
  "Ooh, juicy. I'd heard something close. Lean closer."
  "Really? I always had a feeling. A mild feeling."
  "Shh! Let me close the window. Okay, go."
@rule core.gossip.r_ask act: ask_about
  "Wait, who told you that? Was it the goose?"
  "Hmm, is that true? You'd better be sure."
@rule core.gossip.r_agree act: agree
  "I know! They do that all the time. It's their thing."
@rule core.gossip.r_disagree act: disagree
  "Hmm, I don't think so. They've always been nice to me."
  "Oh, I wouldn't say that. They're not as bad as all that."
@rule core.gossip.r_defend act: defend
  "Be fair, they've had a hard week. We all do."
@rule core.gossip.r_joke act: joke
  "My lips are sealed. {.}Okay, they're loose. Spill."
  "I'm not a gossip, I'm a collector. Of facts. And rumours."
@rule core.gossip.r_laugh act: laugh
  "Ha! No way, that's wild. Tell me everything."
@rule core.gossip.r_back act: backchannel
  "Mm-hm. Go on. I'm listening, but I'm not telling anyone."
@rule core.gossip.r_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: gossip
  "Ooh, a secret! I won't tell. I'll only tell my rock."
@rule core.defend.r_thank act: thank
  "Thanks for sticking up for me. I owe you a pie."
  "That means a lot. Everyone needs a defender."
@rule core.defend.r_agree act: agree
  "Exactly! It wasn't their fault, or mine. It was the fog."
@rule core.defend.r_joke act: joke
  "I'd like to thank my lawyer. That's you, {you}."
@rule core.defend.r_disagree act: disagree
  "That's kind, but I'd rather they said it to my face."
@rule core.accuse.r_disagree act: disagree
  "That wasn't me! It was a ghost. A very polite one."
  "Excuse me? I have witnesses. Well, I have a goose."
@rule core.accuse.r_agree act: agree
  "Okay, okay, you've got me. I did it, a bit."
@rule core.accuse.r_joke act: joke
  "I plead the fifth. And the sixth. And all the pie."
@rule core.accuse.r_defend act: defend
  "Hold on, let's not pile on. There might be an explanation."
@rule core.accuse.r_blame act: blame
  "If anyone's guilty, it's the one who left the door open."
@rule core.take_side.r_thank act: thank
  "Thank you for backing me up. You're a true friend."
  "Ha! Right again. I love it when we agree on me."
@rule core.take_side.r_agree act: agree
  "See? Even {you} sees it. Two of us is a majority."
@rule core.take_side.r_disagree act: disagree
  "Oh, I don't need a side. I need a nap."
@rule core.take_side.r_joke act: joke
  "Sides! I'll take the one with the snacks."
@rule core.mediate.r_agree act: agree
  "Okay, okay. You're right. Let's all breathe."
  "Fine, a truce. A small, shaky, snack-based truce."
@rule core.mediate.r_apologize act: apologize
  "Sorry, everyone. I got heated. It's the weather."
@rule core.mediate.r_disagree act: disagree
  "Easy for you to say. You weren't there. I was there."
@rule core.mediate.r_joke act: joke
  "Peace in our time! Or at least until lunch."
